### ========================================================
### 1. MANAJEMEN USER & TOKO (PENJUAL & PEMBELI)
### ========================================================

### A. Buka Toko 1: Toko Kopi Nusantara (Role: SELLER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Kopi Nusantara",
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "role": "SELLER"
}

### B. Buka Toko 2: Toko Sepatu Original (Role: SELLER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Sepatu Original",
  "email": "sepatuori@mail.com",
  "role": "SELLER"
}

### C. Daftar Akun Pembeli: Budi Santoso (Role: BUYER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "role": "BUYER"
}

### D. Lihat Semua User (Daftar Pengguna Marketplace)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### E. Lihat Hanya Penjual / Toko Saja (?role=SELLER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?role=SELLER


### ========================================================
### 2. PRODUK & RELASI TOKO
### ========================================================

### A. Toko 1 Upload Produk: Kopi Gayo (sellerId: 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai premium 250g",
  "price": 85000.0,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1
}

### B. Toko 2 Upload Produk: Sepatu Nike (sellerId: 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sepatu Lari Nike Pegasus",
  "description": "Ukuran 42 warna hitam sporty",
  "price": 850000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Sepatu",
  "sellerId": 2
}

### C. VALIDASI GAGAL: Pembeli (ID: 3) Coba Upload Barang
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Hanya akun dengan role SELLER yang bisa menjual produk!")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barang Ilegal",
  "description": "Coba upload",
  "price": 10000.0,
  "stock": 1,
  "category": "Umum",
  "sellerId": 3
}

### D. Lihat Semua Produk (Sekarang berisi informasi Toko Penjualnya!)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### E. Lihat Etalase Toko 1 Saja (Semua barang milik Toko Kopi Nusantara)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/products


### ========================================================
### 3. CHECKOUT & TRANSAKSI
### ========================================================

### A. Checkout: Beli 2 Kopi Gayo (ID: 1, Qty: 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### B. Update Status Order Jadi PAID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}

### C. Cek Semua Riwayat Pesanan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
